  Let $\ket{\psi} \in \cal{H}_A \otimes \cal{H}_B$ be a quantum state, and for
  all $x\in \mX$, $\{A^x_a\}$ and $\{B^x_a\}$ POVMs.
  We write
  \begin{equation*}
    A^x_a \otimes I_\bob \simeq_\delta I_\alice \otimes B^x_a
  \end{equation*}
